# Never commit anyone's tax documents or generated filings
itr-wala-workspace/
*AIS*
*26AS*
*Form16*
*form16*
*TIS*
*Challan*
*ACK*
*.ack
income.json
computation.json
computation.txt
filing-pack.md

# The patterns above match by NAME, so they also swallow the skill's own
# source - decrypt_ais.py, parse_26as.py, extract_tis.py and friends are named
# for the documents they read. Re-include skill source explicitly. Only code
# and docs: a stray statement dropped under skills/ stays ignored.
!skills/**/*.py
!skills/**/*.md
!skills/**/*.json

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.idea/
